              ],
              "quotes": [
                "A night of sleep moves through four stages in a fixed order",
                "1. Light sleep, when the body begins to relax.",
                "2. Deeper sleep, when heart rate and breathing slow down.",
                "3. Slow-wave sleep, the deepest stage, when the brain is hardest to wake.",
                "4. REM sleep, when most vivid dreams occur."
              ]
            },
            {
              "label": "sleep affects recall of studied material",
              "chunkIds": [
                "chk_086e3ef6bbaa_6",
